WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.400
(Episode 63)

00:00:02.360 --> 00:00:03.160
Lakukan saja

00:00:05.280 --> 00:00:06.080
Ayah, kamu...

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:10.200
Tuan Linken, apa taruhannya masih berlaku?

00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:11.360
Tentu saja berlaku

00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:13.080
Baik

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:17.360
Tunggu!

00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:21.960
Apakah ini 
jebakan kalian?

00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:23.480
Siapa kamu?

00:00:23.840 --> 00:00:25.040
Berani ragukan 
Tuan Linken?

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:27.440
Aku gak punya 
maksud lain

00:00:27.480 --> 00:00:29.560
aku hanya 
menebak saja

00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:32.680
Bagaimana kalau Tandi pura-pura mati?

00:00:33.040 --> 00:00:35.240
Kalau Tandi 
pura-pura mati 

00:00:35.760 --> 00:00:38.240
Tuan Linken gak perlu turun tangan

00:00:38.240 --> 00:00:40.520
aku pun bisa menyelamatkannya

00:00:40.520 --> 00:00:41.440
Hahaha

00:00:41.440 --> 00:00:42.840
Benar juga, masuk akal

00:00:42.840 --> 00:00:45.240
Tuan Riko memang berpikir dengan matang

00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:46.960
Hal itu memang mungkin terjadi 

00:00:47.640 --> 00:00:48.360
Riko

00:00:49.360 --> 00:00:49.520
Ya

00:00:49.840 --> 00:00:51.640
Pemikiranmu memang sangat matang

00:00:51.640 --> 00:00:52.120
Selain itu

00:00:52.120 --> 00:00:54.760
hal itu memang mungkin terjadi 

00:00:54.760 --> 00:00:55.560
Begini saja 

00:00:56.440 --> 00:00:57.560
Kamu gantikan aku!

00:00:58.600 --> 00:00:59.400
Gak, gak, gak 

00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:01.600
Aku, aku gak bertaruh

00:01:01.720 --> 00:01:04.440
Aku gak mengincar posisi ketua Klan Saga

